        "superseded_justification": "Attempt 0003 faithfully reproduces ARB from transformed FHIR data. The 3,179 differing_null_only rows are explained by the absent MedicationRequest.dispenseRequest.validityPeriod.start/end representation: mimic-fhir/sql/fhir_medication_request.sql:172-177 emits the period only for complete, non-reversed intervals. The two differing_conflict rows are exhaustively replay-attributed to the upstream TIMESTAMPTZ cast at mimic-fhir/sql/fhir_medication_request.sql:43-44, which irreversibly rewrites DST-gap 02:00 wall times to 03:00; no FHIR element or alternate query preserves the original endpoints. The port uses direct TRY_CAST(... AS TIMESTAMP_NTZ), covers direct and mix branches, and has no divergent dependencies. Full schema and row count match; 36,353/39,534 rows are identical.",
